      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200720072002E002E002E00200055007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "CUUUT!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430055005500550054002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s wrong, Carvanha? You need to attack\nthem! Like, ferociously!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007420190073002000770072006F006E0067002C002000430061007200760061006E00680061003F00200059006F00750020006E00650065006400200074006F002000610074007400610063006B000A007400680065006D00210020004C0069006B0065002C0020006600650072006F00630069006F00750073006C0079002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Blup blup...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006C0075007000200062006C00750070002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh, Director? I was looking up facts about\nCarvanha between takes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002C0020004400690072006500630074006F0072003F0020004900200077006100730020006C006F006F006B0069006E0067002000750070002000660061006300740073002000610062006F00750074000A00430061007200760061006E006800610020006200650074007700650065006E002000740061006B00650073002E002E002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apparently it gets very timid when it’s all by itself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100700070006100720065006E0074006C00790020006900740020006700650074007300200076006500720079002000740069006D006900640020007700680065006E0020006900742019007300200061006C006C00200062007900200069007400730065006C0066002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?! How am I supposed to get the footage I’m\nlooking for, then?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F002100200048006F007700200061006D0020004900200073007500700070006F00730065006400200074006F0020006700650074002000740068006500200066006F006F0074006100670065002000492019006D000A006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200066006F0072002C0020007400680065006E003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But now that I think about it... A Carvanha that’s\nscared of humans, hmm?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s not bad—not bad at all!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020006E006F007400200062006100642014006E006F0074002000620061006400200061007400200061006C006C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s not what I had in mind, but we might still get\nsome really good footage from all this!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Carvanha scared of humans... Such a unique\nscene! It’s going to make for some fine footage.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m glad filming’s underway, anyway.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4188,
